  "note": "ECAM procedure for all HS-TX; QRH procedure for ALL."
 },
 "summary": "The stabilizer no longer moves electrically. Two versions: the amber ECAM with alternate law, or no ECAM with normal law, where the QRH procedure applies. Check the pitch trim wheel first. If it works, trim to keep the elevators at neutral on the F/CTL SD page. If not, the landing is FLAP LVR 3 and the gear goes down only in CONF 3 at VAPP, because direct law then removes the autotrim.",
