  {
   "text": "Trimming for neutral elevator provides maximum authority to the elevators. Elevators in the UP position: move the wheel nose UP. Elevators in the DOWN position: move the wheel nose DOWN. Neutral is shown on the F/CTL SD page.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
